      "content": "I am deeply sorry for the pain and devastation you are feeling, as the loss of a 22-year life so quickly is an unimaginable blow. It is natural to feel like you made a mistake when nothing seems to make sense, but please know that your self-worth is not tied to a single outcome or a corporate end. Many people in similar dramatic situations find that the most important \"savings\" you can ever make again are the self and the peace you start to reclaim by choosing to help yourself.",
